    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Local scope and interpretation",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Six local Kafka brokers \u00c2\u00b7 18 partitions \u00c2\u00b7 replication factor 2 \u00c2\u00b7 min ISR 2. Unbounded Flink source; Kafka transactions commit at checkpoints. Archive counters follow immutable segment readback and durable local progress. ClickHouse counts deduplicate output coordinates. These counters do not prove full identity reconciliation. Final tail windows remain open until later event time. This is a calibration workload, not a 1\u00e2\u20ac\u201c2 GiB capacity result."
      }
    },
