      "id": 19,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Flink samples after filtering (limit 20000)",
      "description": "Per-target count after the existing split filter. Warning above 16000 for 30 seconds while up=1; hard limit 20000. Scrape diagnostics can remain visible when application metrics are rejected.",
      "gridPos": {
